### 1. Scaling Food Production & Culinary Preparation Subsystem

**Permanent Prohibitions (Immutable – Updated v21.0)**  
- No crop requiring chemical/thermal/biological/mechanical detoxification.  
- **No wheat or any cereal grains — zero tolerance**. No threshing, milling, grinding, flour, or industrial farming of grains.  
- No kale.  
- **Processing limited to**: wash, peel (optional), cut, chop, slice, mash, boil, pressure-cook, steam, grill, flat-top only — plus **simple manual/mechanical grinding and blending** of perennial tubers/fruits/berries/leaves (sunchoke/kudzu rhizomes into flour, berries into purees, moringa into powders) via hand-crank, manual, or low-power Optimus-assisted grinders/blenders. No high-energy electric or industrial units. Enables efficient flatbreads, pancakes, thickening, jams, and powders.  
